/ Always renders disabled: laying off needs cards selected, and a fresh render
/ never has a selection (a turbo re-render resets the checkboxes). rummy-turn
/ enables it as soon as something is picked. Failing closed also means a broken
/ JS bundle leaves melds unclickable rather than clickable-but-useless.
button.meld type="button" disabled=true data-action="click->rummy-turn#layOff" data-rummy-turn-target="meld" data-rummy-turn-meld-index-param=index
  .meld__header
    span.meld__label = meld.label
    span.meld__owner = meld.owner

  .meld__cards
    - meld.cards.each do |card|
      span.meld__card class=("meld__card--red" if card.red?) = card.to_s
